# Windows "downloaded from the internet" markers left behind by ZIP extraction.
*:Zone.Identifier

# --- Confidential third-party material -----------------------------------------
# The GENCHIP Design Rule Manual states it may not be "reproduced, transmitted, or
# translated, in any form or by any means" without written permission, and is
# subject to US export control law. Both the manual and the rules transcribed from
# it are therefore excluded by default. Remove these lines only with permission.
data/*.pdf
data/genchip_drm_rules.json
